{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2023-05-22 10:10:00', 'title': 'SQM ANNOUNCES LONG-TERM LITHIUM SUPPLY AGREEMENT WITH FORD MOTOR COMPANY', 'text': 'SANTIAGO, CHILE , MAY 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SOCIEDAD QUÍMICA Y MINERA DE CHILE S.A. (SQM) (NYSE: SQM; SANTIAGO STOCK EXCHANGE: SQM-B, SQM-A) AND FORD MOTOR COMPANY HAVE ANNOUNCED A LONG-TERM STRATEGIC AGREEMENT TO SECURE THE SUPPLY OF HIGH-QUALITY LITHIUM PRODUCTS FOR PRODUCTION OF ELECTRIC VEHICLES.'}{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2023-05-22 07:00:00', 'title': 'COMPASS MINERALS SIGNS BINDING MULTIYEAR AGREEMENT TO SUPPLY FORD MOTOR COMPANY WITH BATTERY-GRADE LITHIUM CARBONATE', 'text': 'OVERLAND PARK, KAN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--COMPASS MINERALS (NYSE: CMP), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF ESSENTIAL MINERALS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE SIGNING OF A BINDING, MULTIYEAR SUPPLY AGREEMENT TO PROVIDE FORD MOTOR COMPANY (FORD; NYSE: F), A GLOBAL AUTO MANUFACTURER, WITH BATTERY-GRADE LITHIUM CARBONATE FROM ITS OGDEN, UTAH, LITHIUM BRINE DEVELOPMENT PROJECT. “WE ARE EXCITED TO FORMALIZE A LONG-TERM RELATIONSHIP WITH FORD, ONE OF THE MOST TRUSTED AND ICONIC BRANDS IN THE AUTOMOTIVE INDUSTRY AND A LEAD.'}{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2023-05-22 06:30:00', 'title': 'ENERGYSOURCE MINERALS (ESM) ANNOUNCES CONTRACT WITH FORD FOR GEOTHERMAL LITHIUM', 'text': 'ESM WILL SUPPLY FORD WITH SUSTAINABLE, AMERICAN-SOURCED LITHIUM FOR USE IN FUTURE EVS SAN DIEGO , MAY 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ENERGYSOURCE MINERALS (ESM) ANNOUNCES A BINDING LITHIUM SUPPLY CONTRACT WITH FORD MOTOR COMPANY. ESM IS AN EMERGING LEADER IN THE DOMESTIC PRODUCTION OF SUSTAINABLY PRODUCED LITHIUM, A CRITICAL COMPONENT USED TO MANUFACTURE CATHODES IN ELECTRIC VEHICLE (EV) BATTERIES.'}{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2023-05-22 06:00:00', 'title': 'COMPANY SAYS FORD+ IS MAXIMIZING VALUE FOR CUSTOMERS, IMPROVING BUSINESS RESILIENCE, EFFICIENCY, GROWTH, MARGINS', 'text': "DEARBORN, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LESS THAN TWO QUARTERS INTO FULL DEPLOYMENT, THE TEAMS BEHIND THE FORD+ GROWTH PLAN'S NEW CUSTOMER-CENTERED BUSINESS SEGMENTS ARE REDEFINING CUSTOMER VALUE, WHILE AT THE SAME TIME REDUCING CYCLICALITY, IMPROVING CAPITAL EFFICIENCY, AND GENERATING PROFITABLE GROWTH AND STRONG FREE CASH FLOW. THAT'S THE ESSENTIAL MESSAGE OF CEO JIM FARLEY, CFO JOHN LAWLER AND OTHER FORD LEADERS TO HUNDREDS OF INVESTORS, ANALYSTS AND OTHERS ATTENDING THE COMPANY'S CAPITAL MARKETS."}